POST /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/access/bookmarks/{bookmark_id}
Create a new Bookmark application.
Required: bookmark_id (path); account_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/access/bookmarks/{bookmark_id}
Deletes a Bookmark application.
Required: bookmark_id (path); account_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/access/bookmarks/{bookmark_id}
Fetches a single Bookmark application.
Required: bookmark_id (path); account_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/access/bookmarks/{bookmark_id}
Updates a configured Bookmark application.
Required: bookmark_id (path); account_id (path)
